OL,3,GNEWSACard glitch 'another deterrent' to
OL,4,Ausing Metro
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rail payment card system glitch
OL,7,Fpreventing users topping up their
OL,8,Faccounts since Friday is "yet another
OL,9,Fdeterrent" to using local trains, a
OL,10,Fpassenger group has said.
OL,12,FSome using Pop cards via Google Pay on
OL,13,Fthe Tyne and Wear Metro have not been
OL,14,Fable to add funds, leaving them unable
OL,15,Fto use them to travel.
OL,17,FNexus' head of ICT, Steve Duchar, said
OL,18,Fon Monday it was working with its
OL,19,Fsupplier but had no date for when the
OL,20,Ferrors would be fixed. The company
OL,21,Fconfirmed on Tuesday the issue had been
OL,22,Fresolved.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
